  "system": {
    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p>Make an attack against a target within Melee range. On a success, <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to deal [[/r 1d8+2]] physical damage. A target who marks HP from this attack begins <em>Bleeding</em> until they clear at least 1 HP. A <em>Bleeding</em> target must roll a d6 before they make an action roll. On a result of 4 or lower, they must mark a HP.</p>",
